      "message": "+1. I also wonder about error handling in general. What\u0027s the behavior if:\n- the partition doesn\u0027t exist\n- there is no postinstall script for the partition\n- there is no OTA\n- update_engine failed to trigger the postinstall script\n\nMy understanding is that update_engine [converts](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/update_engine/aosp/binder_service_android_common.h;l\u003d29;drc\u003d60545d5caebd2d51949000994964458249a234c3) any error to [ServiceSpecificException](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/os/ServiceSpecificException.java). Is that correct? If so, please document this behavior with @throw. Thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "02caa0ae_799b2301",
