      "message": "Discussed with Victor offline. Given that update_engine [puts an error code](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/update_engine/aosp/binder_service_android_common.h;l\u003d31;drc\u003d60545d5caebd2d51949000994964458249a234c3) in `ServiceSpecificException` that is specific enough and allows callers to handle different errors differently, it\u0027s fine to throw `ServiceSpecificException`. Please just add a @throw and document that the error code in `ServiceSpecificException` is one of the codes defined in [`UpdateEngine.ErrorCode`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/os/UpdateEngine.java;l\u003d185;drc\u003dfaf2ba91259b85dc02a86253b65b25d35a6d2ec5).",
